# Googlebook OS "Tablet modu" (T870-araclar/tablet-modu). The quick settings tile runs as the
# user's app uid; the kernel creates sec_keypad/tablet_mode root-only (0644). SELinux limits
# writers to priv-apps (71-gbos-tablet-modu.cil). Without kernel patch 0002 the node is missing,
# chmod fails harmlessly and the app keeps its tile hidden.
on boot
    chmod 0666 /sys/devices/virtual/sec/sec_keypad/tablet_mode
